---
/**
 * The banner every inner page opens with: an ink field the width of the
 * viewport and the headline in paper, set at the display size. Nothing else:
 * no eyebrow, no subtitle. The headline names the page; what belongs up here
 * (the contact buttons, the address) goes in `after`.
 *
 * One component so the pages cannot drift from each other, and so the field
 * and the reveal timings are decided once. Banner posture: the first section
 * shows above the fold.
 */
---

<section class="field-ink relative" style="view-transition-name:field">
  <div class="wrap pb-14 pt-14 lg:pb-20 lg:pt-24">
    <h1 class="display-xl max-w-[16ch] text-display" data-reveal>
      <slot />
    </h1>

    <slot name="after" />
  </div>
</section>
